        "original_id": "866110fd-4744-53e8-8b9b-b586cd317c3a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rob Lowe, Tia Carrere, Lara Flynn Boyle, Brian Doyle-Murray, Chris Farley, Ed O'Neill, Ione Skye, Meat Loaf, Alice Cooper, Dana Carvey\n- Works: Wayne's World, Wayne's World 2, Saturday Night Live\n- Organizations: Chicago's Second City Theatre, NBC\n- Roles: Garth Algar\n\nFacts:\n- Dana Carvey was born on June 2, 1955.\n- Dana Carvey was a cast member on NBC's Saturday Night Live from 1986 to 1993.\n- Chris Farley was a member of Chicago's Second City Theatre before joining NBC's Saturday Night Live.\n- Chris Farley was a cast member of NBC's Saturday Night Live from 1990 to 1995.\n- Wayne's World was released in 1992 and features Rob Lowe, Tia Carrere, Lara Flynn Boyle, Brian Doyle-Murray, Chris Farley, Ed O'Neill, Ione Skye, Meat Loaf, and Alice Cooper.\n- Dana Carvey played Garth Algar in Wayne's World in 1992.\n- Dana Carvey played Garth Algar in Wayne's World 2 in 1993.\n- Chris Farley was known for his loud, energetic comedic style.",
